Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### [AUTH] Update thread name
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{agentId}}/threads/{{threadId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Renamed Thread"
}

### [AUTH] Update thread — not found (expect 404)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{agentId}}/threads/nonexistentThreadId
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Ghost Thread Rename"
}

### [AUTH] Stream a message in a thread
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/{{agentId}}/threads/{{threadId}}/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "message": "Hello, what can you help me with?",
  "model": "google_genai:gemini-3.1-flash-lite"
}

### [AUTH] Stream — agent not found (expect 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/agents/nonexistentAgentId12345/threads/{{threadId}}/stream
